# 31. COMMON EXPOSED RESOURCE CHECKS

A scanner may check a **small, carefully selected** list of known resource names within an authorized lab.

Examples:

```text
robots.txt
sitemap.xml
security.txt
```

The scanner can record:

```text
Status
Content-Type
Length
```

Avoid turning the scanner into an uncontrolled wordlist attack.

---

# 32. DO NOT CONFUSE ROBOTS.TXT WITH SECURITY

`robots.txt` tells compliant crawlers what site owners prefer not to crawl.

It is **not an access-control mechanism**.

Therefore:

```text
robots.txt
≠
Authentication
≠
Authorization
```

