# 33. FINDING SEVERITY

A scanner should classify findings.

Example:

| Severity | Example |
|---|---|
| Informational | Server banner exposed |
| Low | Missing non-critical security header |
| Medium | Weak security configuration |
| High | Confirmed serious security weakness |
| Critical | Severe validated vulnerability with major impact |

### Important

Do not automatically label every scanner finding as High/Critical.

